msgstr "1. 在 nginx 主機上"

msgid "2. On the Nginx UI container"
msgstr "2. 在 Nginx UI 容器上"

msgid "Run these on the machine that runs nginx, as a user who can use sudo."
msgstr "請在執行 nginx 的機器上，以可使用 sudo 的使用者身分執行下列指令。"

msgid "Run these on the machine that runs nginx, as the SSH user configured above."
msgstr "請在執行 nginx 的機器上，以上方設定的 SSH 使用者身分執行下列指令。"

msgid "Install the public key"
msgstr "安裝公鑰"

msgid ""
"Creates %{file} with the permissions sshd requires and appends the key. "
"sshd silently ignores an authorized_keys file that other users can write, "
"which shows up later as a permission denied error."
msgstr ""
"以 sshd 要求的權限建立 %{file} 並附加金鑰。若 authorized_keys 檔案可被其他使用者寫入，sshd "
"會直接忽略它，之後便會出現 permission denied 錯誤。"

msgid ""
"The same key on its own, for appending by hand. To restrict where it may be "
"used from, prefix it with from='…'."
msgstr "僅金鑰本身的內容，供手動附加使用。若要限制可從何處使用，請在前面加上 from='…'。"

msgid "Open the sudoers file"
msgstr "開啟 sudoers 檔案"

msgid ""
"visudo checks the syntax before saving, so a typo cannot lock you out of "
"sudo."
msgstr "visudo 會在儲存前檢查語法，因此打錯字不會讓您失去 sudo 權限。"

msgid "sudoers rules"
msgstr "sudoers 規則"

msgid ""
"Paste this into the editor visudo opened, then save and exit. It lets the "
"SSH user reload nginx without a password."
msgstr "將此內容貼到 visudo 開啟的編輯器中，然後儲存並離開。這可讓 SSH 使用者無需密碼即可重新載入 nginx。"

msgid "File access check"
msgstr "檔案存取檢查"

msgid "File permissions"
msgstr "檔案權限"

msgid ""
"Run as the SSH user. Both commands only test access and change nothing. A "
"failure means the SSH user cannot reach the Homebrew paths."
msgstr "以 SSH 使用者身分執行。這兩個指令只會測試存取權限，不會變更任何內容。若失敗，表示該 SSH 使用者無法存取 Homebrew 路徑。"

msgid ""
"Run as root. Grants the SSH user write access to the nginx config directory "
"and read access to the logs, including files created later, plus read "
"access to the PID file."
msgstr "以 root 身分執行。授予 SSH 使用者對 nginx 設定目錄的寫入權限、對日誌（含日後新增的檔案）的讀取權限，以及對 PID 檔案的讀取權限。"

msgid "Nothing else to install on the host"
msgstr "主機上不需要再安裝任何內容"

msgid ""
"A Homebrew launchd service runs as the SSH user, so no sudoers entry or "
"extra permissions are needed."
msgstr "Homebrew 的 launchd 服務會以 SSH 使用者身分執行，因此不需要 sudoers 條目或額外權限。"

msgid "The SSH user is root, so no sudoers entry or extra permissions are needed."
msgstr "SSH 使用者為 root，因此不需要 sudoers 條目或額外權限。"

msgid ""
"Pick the format that matches how you run Nginx UI, then recreate the "
"container with the bind mounts."
msgstr "選擇符合目前 Nginx UI 執行方式的格式，然後使用綁定掛載重建容器。"

msgid ""
"Linux Docker Engine requires this host-gateway mapping for "
"host.docker.internal. No directory mounts are added."
msgstr "Linux Docker Engine 需要透過此 host-gateway 對應提供 host.docker.internal，不會新增目錄掛載。"

msgid "Recreating the container closes this page"
msgstr "重建容器會關閉此頁面"

msgid "Finish the host side first, then come back here."
msgstr "請先完成主機端的設定，再回到此處。"

