"Merge this under services.nginx-ui in your existing file. Each bind mount "
"uses the same path inside the container as on the host."
msgstr "請將此段合併到現有檔案的 services.nginx-ui 之下。每個綁定掛載在容器內使用與主機相同的路徑。"

