msgstr "片段"

msgid ""
"Include keeps the site linked to snippets/%{file}, so later changes of the "
"snippet apply to it. Insert copies the content into the site instead."
msgstr "引用會讓網站與 snippets/%{file} 保持關聯，之後對片段的修改都會作用到網站。插入則會把內容複製到網站中。"

msgid "Insert"
msgstr "插入"

msgid "Include"
msgstr "Include 行"

msgid ""
"Blocklist sources fetch lists of addresses to deny from plugins and write "
"them as deny rules to a file of their own. Nothing is blocked until you add "
"the include line of a source to a server or location block."
msgstr ""
"封鎖清單來源會從外掛取得要拒絕的位址清單，並將其寫入各自專屬的檔案作為拒絕規"
"則。在您將某個來源的 Include 行加入 server 或 location 區塊之前，不會封鎖任何"
"內容。"

msgid "Refresh Now"
msgstr "立即重新整理"

msgid ""
"No enabled plugin offers a blocklist source. Install and enable a plugin "
"with the security.blocklist capability first."
msgstr ""
"沒有已啟用的外掛提供封鎖清單來源。請先安裝並啟用具有 security.blocklist 能力"
"的外掛。"

msgid "Select a source type"
msgstr "選擇來源類型"

msgid ""
"The plugin that provides this source type is not enabled. The list is kept "
"but no longer refreshed."
msgstr "提供此來源類型的外掛未啟用。清單會被保留，但不再重新整理。"

msgid ""
"How often the list is fetched again, in seconds. Nginx is reloaded only when "
"the list changed."
msgstr ""
"以秒為單位設定清單重新取得的頻率。僅當清單發生變化時才會重新載入 Nginx。"

msgid ""
"Add this line to a server or location block to deny the listed addresses "
"there."
msgstr "將此行加入 server 或 location 區塊，以在該處拒絕清單中的位址。"

